Absolutely. Since **Phase 1 is the foundation**, Phase 2 should focus strictly on building a **production-ready authentication system** without yet implementing Employee Management, Attendance, Leave, Payroll, etc.

Below is a detailed implementation prompt you can give to an AI coding agent (Cursor, Antigravity, Claude Code, etc.). It is intentionally written in the same style as your Phase 1 prompt and preserves the architecture needed for the later **Multi-tenancy + RBAC** phase.

# PHASE 2 — AUTHENTICATION DEVELOPMENT

## Modern Attendance & HRMS SaaS Platform

---

