# PART B — PHASE 2 OBJECTIVE

# 3. Main objective

Build a **secure, scalable, production-ready authentication system** on top of the Phase 1 foundation.

At the end of Phase 2, the system should support:

```text
User
 │
 ├── Register
 │
 ├── Login
 │
 ├── Access Token
 │
 ├── Refresh Token
 │
 ├── Logout
 │
 ├── Current User
 │
 ├── Password Hashing
 │
 ├── Password Change
 │
 ├── Password Reset
 │
 └── Email Verification
```

The architecture must be designed so that Phase 3 can add:

```text
Tenant
 │
 ├── User
 │
 ├── Roles
 │
 └── Permissions
```

without rewriting the authentication system.

