password_service.py
```

Use names appropriate to the existing project architecture.

---

# 50. Do not put authentication logic in main.py

Do NOT create a large:

```text
main.py
```

containing:

```text
registration
login
JWT generation
password hashing
database queries
email sending
```

Keep these components modular.

