# PART AQ — COMPLETE AUTHENTICATION FLOW

# 99. Registration flow

The final flow should conceptually be:

```text
              REGISTER
                  │
                  ▼
            Validate Input
                  │
                  ▼
           Normalize Email
                  │
                  ▼
          Check Existing User
                  │
                  ▼
          Hash Password
                  │
                  ▼
             Create User
                  │
                  ▼
       Create Verification Token
                  │
                  ▼
          Queue Email Task
                  │
                  ▼
          Registration Done
                  │
                  ▼
        Verify Email Later
```

---

# 100. Login flow

```text
               LOGIN
                 │
                 ▼
          Validate Request
                 │
                 ▼
         Normalize Email
                 │
                 ▼
           Find User
                 │
                 ▼
        Verify Password
                 │
          ┌──────┴──────┐
          │             │
        Invalid        Valid
          │             │
       Reject      Check Status
                        │
                        ▼
                 Create Session
                        │
              ┌─────────┴─────────┐
              ▼                   ▼
        Access Token        Refresh Token
              │                   │
              └─────────┬─────────┘
                        ▼
                  Login Response
```

---

# 101. Refresh flow

```text
Refresh Token
      │
      ▼
Validate JWT
      │
      ▼
Check Token Type
      │
      ▼
Check Session
      │
      ▼
Check Revocation
      │
      ▼
Rotate Token
      │
      ├── Old token revoked
      │
      └── New token generated
                 │
                 ▼
        Access + Refresh Token
```

---

# 102. Logout flow

```text
Logout
  │
  ▼
Identify Session
  │
  ▼
Revoke Refresh Token
  │
  ▼
Session marked revoked
  │
  ▼
Client clears authentication state
```

---

# 103. Password reset flow

```text
Forgot Password
       │
       ▼
Enter Email
       │
       ▼
Generate Secure Token
       │
       ▼
Hash + Store Token
       │
       ▼
Send Email
       │
       ▼
User Opens Link
       │
       ▼
Reset Password
       │
       ▼
Invalidate Token
       │
       ▼
Revoke Sessions
```

---

# 104. Email verification flow

```text
Register
   │
   ▼
Verification Token
   │
   ▼
Email
   │
   ▼
User Clicks Link
   │
   ▼
Validate Token
   │
   ▼
Mark User Verified
   │
   ▼
Token Invalidated
```

---

