# PART AS — SECURITY VERIFICATION

# 113. Before completion, explicitly verify

### Password security

```text
No plaintext passwords
No password logging
Modern password hashing
```

### JWT security

```text
Secret from environment
Short access-token lifetime
Refresh-token expiration
Refresh-token rotation
Revocation support
```

### API security

```text
Protected endpoints
Correct HTTP status codes
No stack traces
No sensitive response data
```

### Frontend security

```text
No hard-coded credentials
No secrets in source code
Safe authentication state
No unnecessary long-lived tokens in localStorage
```

### Infrastructure

```text
No secrets committed
CORS configured
Redis protected appropriately
Database credentials from environment
```

