# FINAL ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

The authentication system must be built with this future architecture in mind:

```text
                    USER
                     │
                     ▼
               AUTHENTICATION
                     │
          ┌──────────┴──────────┐
          │                     │
          ▼                     ▼
       SESSION                IDENTITY
          │                     │
          └──────────┬──────────┘
                     ▼
                 TENANT
                     │
                     ▼
                   RBAC
                     │
          ┌──────────┼──────────┐
          ▼          ▼          ▼
       Employee   Manager      Admin
          │          │          │
          └──────────┼──────────┘
                     ▼
               HRMS FEATURES
                     │
      ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
      ▼              ▼              ▼
 Attendance        Leave         Payroll
      │              │              │
      └──────────────┼──────────────┘
                     ▼
                 Reporting
                     │
                     ▼
                 Analytics
                     │
                     ▼
                    AI
```

**The key rule is:** Phase 2 should establish **identity and secure authentication**, while Phase 3 will establish **tenant identity and authorization**. This separation will make the later HRMS modules much easier to scale and secure.
